{"id":"n71463-1-25","stage":0,"title":"앉다 · 坐","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71463-1-25-1","ko":"오래 걸었더니 다리가 아파.","zh":"走了太久，腿好疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸었더니","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다리가","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파.","meaning":"疼，痛","explanation":"아프다：疼，痛；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"2","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f64811b687303a9","term":"오래","zh":"好久，很久","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3","entryId":"57308","definition":"长时间。","pronunciation":["오래"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼，痛","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"身体的某些部位使用过多而感到疲劳或难受。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4068f17a00e58dfa68c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71463-1-25-2","ko":"그럼 저 벤치에 앉아서 잠시 쉬었다가 갈까?","zh":"那我们坐在那边的长椅上休息一会儿再走吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벤치에","meaning":"长椅，长凳","explanation":"벤치：长椅，长凳；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"벤치","audio":"/audio/b3d3498d71a504039132.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14466","senseId":"1","lemma":"벤치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉아서","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬었다가","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈까?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"b3d3498d71a50403","term":"벤치","zh":"长椅，长凳","audio":"/audio/b3d3498d71a504039132.mp3","entryId":"14466","definition":"可以几个人一起坐下的长椅子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/86ca80a372a08ac64603.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71463","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.4652,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那我们坐在那边的长椅上休息一会儿再走吧？","走了太久，腿好疼。","我们今天去看电影怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["走了太久，腿好疼。","我们今天去看电影怎么样？","那我们坐在那边的长椅上休息一会儿再走吧？"],"answer":2}]}
